Value Required Slot (\d+)
Value Filldown Product_Model (.+?)
Value BOARD_TYPE (\S+)
Value Release_Ver (.+)
Value Patch_Ver (.+)
Value Filldown Version (.+)

Start
  ^H3C\s+Comware\s+Software,\s+Version\s+${Version}\s*$$
  ^H3C\s+${Product_Model}\s+uptime\s+is\s+.+$$
  ^(?:Slot|[A-Z]+(?:\([A-Z]+\))?)\s+${Slot}: -> SLOT

SLOT
  ^(?:Slot|[A-Z]+(?:\([A-Z]+\))?)\s+${Slot}: -> Record SLOT
  ^BOARD\s+TYPE:\s+${BOARD_TYPE}\s*$$
  ^Release\s+Version:\s+${Release_Ver}\s*$$
  ^Patch\s+Version\s*:\s+${Patch_Ver}\s*$$
  ^$$ -> Record Start
